## Context

0729 and 0814 deferred a causal country comparison. The author has selected a
study of progression by transition function, public/private finance and operation
histories across South Africa, Indonesia, Viet Nam and Senegal. The adopted
framing is conception/jetp-short-paper-framing-2026-09-15.md.
Use a documented diagnostic sample of existing evidence to test whether all
three dimensions join on the same operations. Record this prior inspection
before freezing the primary analysis. The v3 validator in the execution worktree
is not an approved scientific protocol.

## First test

First documentary check: reconcile two sources for one financing, a mixed
public/private amount without a split, and a milestone with only a publication
date. Count the financing once; retain unknown allocation and event time.
If transformation code is required, encode that fixture before implementation.

## Actions

Deliver a source-linked diagnostic matrix, selected by a documented rule before
examining results, spanning the four countries and incomplete/unsigned cases.
Record the common A/B/C sample, marginal coverage and missing documents.
Define the study question, unit, countries, evidence cutoff, lifecycle-state
taxonomy, per-state denominators, source universe, inclusion/exclusion rules,
money and date semantics, missingness/lost-visibility vocabulary, and permitted
comparisons. Register prohibited claims: causal acceleration, additionality,
total investment and physical delivery. Retain the 0815 routes as named source
leads, not causal tests. Freeze the protocol and independent review before any
cross-country result table is made.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Diagnostic matrix establishes which operations support progression, finance and history together
- [ ] Immutable study/protocol revision names the four-country public/private scope and permitted claims
- [ ] Lifecycle states and denominators cannot be mixed in an aggregate or figure
- [ ] Completeness has a finite source-country-period universe and disposition vocabulary
- [ ] Causal language and zero-filled missingness fail the protocol acceptance check
- [ ] Source census handoff for 0817 is frozen before acquisition

